# Interviewer 8 is served at /v8/ from this deploy (dist/v8). Its deep links
# and reloads get its own shell, so this comes before this app's catch-all.
# Files that exist are served as they are: Netlify does not rewrite over them.
# There is deliberately no "/v8 /v8/ 301": Netlify ignores a trailing slash
# when matching, so that rule would redirect /v8/ to itself forever whenever
# no Interviewer 8 is bundled. Netlify takes /v8 to dist/v8/index.html itself.
/v8/*    /v8/index.html  200
/*       /index.html     200
